ers say a relic monster of 23 m long inhabits Hordh Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Nibamara Monster","legend":"Whispers say a relic monster of 5 m long inhabits Nibamara Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Shushahtar Monster","legend":"Journeying folk say a relic monster of 11 m long inhabits Shushahtar Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Waton Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 51 m long."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Skiping Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 21 m long."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Manch Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 32 m long."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Soles Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 26 m long."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Hausach Vampire","legend":"Tipplers speak of a huge Vampire who inhabits Hausach hills and eats kids whole."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Hepehatom Dragon","legend":"Tales speak of a proud Dragon who inhabits Hepehatom hills and attacks anyone who dares to approach its lair."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Kehyon Banshee","legend":"Legends speak of a giant Banshee who inhabits Kehyon hills and snatches people from homes."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Ebrongengen Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Witnesses of Schofenbach."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Otyery Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Cacobovio Deities."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Haka Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Carthaginian Beliefs."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Tsabo Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Cacobovio Deities."},{"id":"marker95","name":"Saliaras Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Cacobovio Deities."},{"id":"marker96","name":"Tarsgarifara Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Carthaginian Beliefs."},{"id":"marker97","name":"Par Shahra Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Cacobovio Deities."},{"id":"marker98","name":"Finem Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Carthaginian Beliefs."},{"id":"marker99","name":"Kupfheimers Crows","legend":"A gang of swamp brigands."},{"id":"marker100","name":"Sarand Sharks","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker101","name":"Ur-Dadesh Jaguars","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker102","name":"Kouron Snakes","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker103","name":"Eshiba'um Tigers","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker104","name":"Tarfathuel Panthers","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker105","name":"Inverleith Tigers","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker106","name":"Ebron Wolfs","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker107","name":"Marbolzburg Wolverines","legend":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"id":"marker108","name":"Nushamgar Snakes","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker109","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker110","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker111","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker112","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker113","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker114","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker115","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker116","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker117","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker118","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker119","name":"Insanvergeal Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳃ ⳄⳘⳁⳤ ⳧⳹ⳫⳖⳲ⳹ⳜⳀⳌ⳹⳩ⳔⲲⲸ ⲺⳜⳤⳢⳌⳠⳂⲺⳃⳀⳎⳞⳤⳆⳲⳞⳠ⳹ⳜⳲⳤⳞⲼⳆⳐⲼⳢ⳧Ⲻ⳹⳥ⲺⳚⳄⳆⲶⳞⲲⲸⳲⲺ⳧ⳌⳄⳆⳞ⳪ⳠⳄⳭ⳩⳩ⳢⳭⲲⳖ⳥ ⲶⳠⳃⲾⳚⳲⳠⳆⳤ ⳪⳪Ⳃⳃ⳪Ⳛ⳥</div>"},{"id":"marker120","name":"Tzibon Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༮༫༕༿༓༦༌༴༩༡༭༤༊༽༑༸༉༈༱༬༐༼༴༔༱༻༖༪༛༕༲་་༫༌༣༾༛༜༳༫༬༌༖༪༫༾༺་༬༬༑༾༜༵༔༳༇༑༔༵༵༫༛༬༶༂༗༯༈༈༢༑༆༜༑༗༈</div>"},{"id":"marker121","name":"Kesh Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲴⲸⳢ Ⳣ⳩ⳈⳫⳠ⳩ⳤ⳩ⳞⳎ⳹ⳎⲸⳫ ⳫⳬⳔⳒ ⳥ⲲⳂⲲⳔⳌⲼⳫ⳧⳹ⳆⳆⳭⳃⲺⲲⳫ⳾ⳜⲾⳊⳖⳆ ⳚⳒⳁⳚⳞⳭ⳾Ⳏ ⳞⲼⳬⳄ⳹ⳆⳎⳖⲺⳚ</div>"},{"id":"marker122","name":"Tadra Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡖᠭᠧᢏᡔᡗ᠑ᡳᢁᡕᡕᠳᡱᡗᡙᠵᡑᡏᢠᠰᢞ᠐ᠲᠵᡁᡓᢥᢋᠮᡀᠪᡡᡡᡆᡖᢦᠰᡑᢢᡎᡆᡰᡀᢤᢀᢛᡖᡲᡏᡳᡖᠰᡗᡭ</div>"},{"id":"marker123","name":"Rapazor Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc14\udc25\udc17\udc30\udc0d\udc20𐠖\udc28𐠗\udc23\udc21\udc38\ud802\ud802𐠗\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠠𐠥\ud802\ud802𐠖𐠞𐠗𐠒𐠐\udc14 \udc23𐠚\udc03\udc1f\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker124","name":"Serus Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༇༐༕༵༗༰༘༳༚༅༙་༹༙༿༰ༀ༚༸༸༊༁༲༳༫༂༁༭༑༵༩༿༙༣༑༊༈༅༑༇༷༡༐༕༅༠༱༮༌ༀ༳༗༻༁༸༁༢༰༳༪༛༧༒༱༾༚༗༂༤༓༔</div>"},{"id":"marker125","name":"Lenzkirch Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳀⲶⳊⳫⲼ ⲺⳐⲼⳠⳈⲺⳄⳊⳂ⳹Ⳇⳃⳤ⳪ⳒⲸⳠⳘⳁⳂ⳾ⳬⳤⳚ⳧ ⳀⲼⳲ⳩ⳀⲴ⳪⳪ⳖⳈⳖⳬⳠⳊⳢⳐⳖⳞⳃⲺⳖⳭⳜ</div>"},{"id":"marker126","name":"Stenauter Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠭᢥᡕᡭᢋᡁᢠᢓᡱᠽᢤᠾᡳᡓᢓᠮᠰᠭᡓᢓᢤᡔᠰᠰᢀᢤᡳᠡᠿᠪᡯᢡᡲᢑᠡᢏᡱᠿᢢᡖᢋᡓᡗᢒᠦᠽᠩᢤᢢᡀᢢᢓᠳᡍᢂᢥᡯᠭᡰᢛᢦᢀᠳᡗᠠᡒ</div>"},{"id":"marker127","name":"Meyloshahr Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳧ⲶⳖ⳪⳹ⳄⲶⳢⳬⲸⲴⳒⲸ  ⲴⲺⳠⳢⲸ ⳂⳘⳭⳫⳊ⳾ⳜⳫ⳾ⲴⳫ⳾Ⲽ⳾ⲸⳚⳈⳔⲼⳲ⳹Ⳍ⳥ⳠⳲⳲⳜⳢⳈⲼⳫⳄⳄ⳧ⳬⳆⳐⳃⳜⳭⳔ ⲾⳂⲸⳘ⳥ⲺⳲⳘ⳪Ⳑ ⳥⳾ⳞⲴⳃⳃⳆⳀⳖ ⳾ⳘⳞⳐ⳹⳩ⳈⳌⲴⳞⳬⳲ Ⳅ⳧</div>"},{"id":"marker128","name":"Muros Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc0c𐠤\ud802 \udc24\udc17\udc18\udc16𐠰\ud802 𐠬\udc08\udc0c\ud802𐠓\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠩𐠮\ud802\ud802𐠛𐠼\udc1d𐠴\udc20\udc0a𐠴\udc0e\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker129","name":"Gethlefatha Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዘተደሀበፀዐተረዘኀወ ነረሠወሠተኀለገሰነሠ ጸወፀበኀኀፈሠወወሰቀዐጠደሐጰበየገፀሰፈገነመፐኀፀጰኀዐጸአአፐወበረሐዘ ጠአመረሰጠቀፈ በተተሰ ኀ </div>"},{"id":"marker130","name":"Chogheshahr Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc34𐠳\udc2d\udc2c\udc0a𐠣\udc32\udc33𐠱\udc05𐠵\udc31\udc2d\udc0c\udc2f𐠗𐠝\udc34\udc05\ud802𐠘\udc30\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠨\udc3c\ud802 \ud802 \udc1f\udc35 \udc1a𐠱𐠃\ud802𐠁\ud802𐠳𐠴\udc33 \udc18𐠅\udc35\udc29\udc32𐠩\udc11\udc10\udc29\udc3f𐠘𐠣\udc2b\udc0e\udc1e\udc2f\udc08\udc2c\udc3f</div>"},{"id":"marker131","name":"Bridiwg Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc11\udc19\udc0a\udc2e\udc08\udc2b\ud802\ud802 \udc3f\udc04\udc26\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠈𐠄𐠨\udc32𐠤\ud802𐠅\ud802 \udc2f\udc10\udc2b𐠨\udc1e\udc14𐠠\udc13\ud802𐠡</div>"},{"id":"marker132","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker133","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker134","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker135","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker136","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker137","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker138","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker139","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker140","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker141","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker142","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker143","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker144","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker145","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker146","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"