ous waters. Rumors say it can be 26 m long."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Northwark Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 37 m long."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Quatford Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 25 m long."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Luton Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 13 m long."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Dubrinagus Troll","legend":"Rumors speak of a feared Troll who inhabits Dubrinagus hills and keeps the region at bay."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Sondola Ogre","legend":"Inscriptions speak of a terrifying Ogre who inhabits Sondola hills and attacks unsuspecting victims."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Aber Dragon","legend":"Rumors speak of a big Dragon who inhabits Aber hills and eats kids whole."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Tronion Troll","legend":"Legends speak of a prime Troll who inhabits Tronion hills and keeps the region at bay."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Ruretia Beast","legend":"Tipplers speak of a fat Beast who inhabits Ruretia hills and snatches people from homes."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Ponshinver Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Coven of the Emerald Jaguar."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Plentza Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Novallumism."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Contes Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Roman Pantheon."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Inver Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Novallumism."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Moviorum Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Novallumism."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Eiterisch Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Novallumism."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Mascum Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Novallumism."},{"id":"marker95","name":"Banoebieras Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to loca