ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳌⲸⳢⳐⳆⳜ ⳂⲴⲴⳎⳞⳆⳀⳊ⳩ⳠⲾⳐⳚⳫⳬ⳧ⳀⳔⳄⳲⳲⳊⳢ⳩ ⳘⳈⳆⲲⳜⲲⲺⳲ ⳈⳌⳔⳒⳞⳄⳜ</div>"},{"id":"marker118","name":"Atridwrgy Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠰᢒᠡᢥᡓᡀᡎᡳᢒᠵᡡᢥᠿᢡᢥᠭᢑᢂᡑᠳᠡᡓᢂᡏᡠᡰᡡᡏᡝᡙᡏᡝᡁ᠀ᡒᢏ᠒᠀ᢡᢞᠯᢡᠨᠨᢜᡝᠽ᠀ᡙᡮᢠᢓ᠒ᡠᡔᡁᠽᡍᠿᡑ᠒ᡏᡴᡓ</div>"},{"id":"marker119","name":"Obern Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳁⳒⲴⲸⳊ⳩Ⳛ⳪ⳆⳈⲸ⳩ⳲⳔⳂⳬ ⳾ⳫⳢ⳩ⳖⳃⳌ⳥ⳬⳠⳞ⳧ⳊⳤⳘ ⳞⳲⲺ⳥⳾ⳭⳈⲴⳢⳁⳢⲾⳈⲾ ⳖⳠⳈⳒⲸ⳾ⳫⳭ Ⳁ⳪ⳘⳒⳁ⳪ⳘⳈⳖⲴⳲⳈⳘⳔⲺⳈⲶⳢⳔⳫⲼⳊⳚ⳹ⳐⲾⳃⳒⳔⳎⳭⳲ⳩ⳜⳐⳠⳬⳒ⳪Ⲹ ⳾</div>"},{"id":"marker120","name":"Beitiaiana Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠗\udc15\udc1a\udc21\ud802𐠭𐠲𐠯\udc2f𐠂\ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠗𐠅\udc2e𐠸\udc04\udc10\ud802\ud802𐠈𐠏\ud802𐠠\ud802\ud802𐠛 \udc08\ud802𐠔\udc19\udc1d\udc2e</div>"},{"id":"marker121","name":"Gilead Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡱᡭᢁᡰᠲᡟᡔᡖᡞᠮᠳᡰ᠀ᡎᠩᡡᠪᠳᢦᢒᡞᢐᡓᢟᢑᠮᢢᢢᠨᢠᡓᡝᠧᡠᡠᢋᠼᢏᢓᡀᡗᡜᢜᡗᢡᡎᡟᡐᢏᠵᢋᢛᡙᢓᡠᡆᠳᡠᡎᠰᡍᠦᡍᢏᢛᠪᢀᡟᢥᡎᢠᠭᡑᢐᢡᡍᢓᠪ</div>"},{"id":"marker122","name":"Movica Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༊༊༊་༑༭༪༩༆༐༖༵༗༩༄༖༨༶༩༌༼༃༬༷༆༗༒༳༂༻༻༇༵༕༣༓༠༉༆༭༭༊༡༑༣༒༠༒༼༵༌༡༶༶༳༒༜༆༱༚༽༳༧༐༼</div>"},{"id":"marker123","name":"Getzie Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡐ᠑ᢦᢑᡳᠳᠲ᠐ᢓᢥᡟᢛᡲᢛᢐᢓᠮᠻᡡᠨᡯᡐᡟᢀᡴᢏᠰᢜᠱᢏᢠᡎᠮᢜᢀᢠᡏᡏᡜᡏᢦᡐᢢᢠᠧᡲᠯᡯ᠀ᠾᡭᢑᠧᢁᠽᠡ᠐ᡓᢑᢐᠮᠻᡝ</div>"},{"id":"marker124","name":"Lemeindena Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳃ ⳄⳘⳁⳤ ⳧⳹ⳫⳖⳲ⳹ⳜⳀⳌ⳹⳩ⳔⲲⲸ ⲺⳜⳤⳢⳌⳠⳂⲺⳃⳀⳎⳞⳤⳆⳲⳞⳠ⳹ⳜⳲⳤⳞⲼⳆⳐⲼⳢ⳧Ⲻ⳹⳥ⲺⳚⳄⳆⲶⳞⲲⲸⳲⲺ⳧ⳌⳄⳆⳞ⳪ⳠⳄⳭ⳩⳩ⳢⳭⲲⳖ⳥ ⲶⳠⳃⲾⳚⳲⳠⳆⳤ ⳪⳪Ⳃⳃ⳪Ⳛ⳥</div>"},{"id":"marker125","name":"Utio Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༮༫༕༿༓༦༌༴༩༡༭༤༊༽༑༸༉༈༱༬༐༼༴༔༱༻༖༪༛༕༲་་༫༌༣༾༛༜༳༫༬༌༖༪༫༾༺་༬༬༑༾༜༵༔༳༇༑༔༵༵༫༛༬༶༂༗༯༈༈༢༑༆༜༑༗༈</div>"},{"id":"marker126","name":"Albek Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡴᠿᢏᡡᢀᡯᢀᡠᡎᢞᡏᠡᢋᢦᢏᢐᡔᡒᢡᡱ᠐ᠳ᠀ᡔᡍᠩᢏᡳᢞᠽᠽᢒᠵᠨ᠀ᢋᢟᡞᠭᡁᡖᠽᢤᡜᡒᠰᡝᡠᢓᢟᡎᢤᡟᠩᢐᠼᢜᠾᡎᡕᠧᡜᡆᡯᡒᡯᠦᠻᢐᡮᢁᢒᠳᡖᠭᠧᢏᡔᡗ</div>"},{"id":"marker127","name":"Inve Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዐዐቀአነ ረፐሀሰቀኀከ ጸሠተሠየየኀወ ረአ ነኀገተ ጰፐወጠአጠወረዐደገዐገአአገለረበየተጸሠወአተደሠኀዘዐ ጸዐጰኀሀነቀፀ አመደጰሠወ የሠበ</div>"},{"id":"marker128","name":"Eulorum Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳎⲶⳔ⳧ⳁⳞⲸ⳧ Ⳮ⳧ⳘⲼⳂⳆⳬⳊ⳩ⳌⳫⳎⲺⳌⳁ⳹Ⳏ ⳩ⲲⳎⳲⳲⳀⲲ⳪ⳫⳢⲴⲴⳤⳃⳬⳠ ⳌⳖⳃⳀⲼⲺⳃⲼⳭⳔⳂⳈⲸⳔ⳩⳥ⳁⲲⳫⳊ⳾ⲲⳲⲴⳖ⳧ⳫⳠⳐⳜⳃ⳩ ⳎⳊⲴⳘⳄⳆ</div>"},{"id":"marker129","name":"Lenzkirch Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳀⲶⳊⳫⲼ ⲺⳐⲼⳠⳈⲺⳄⳊⳂ⳹Ⳇⳃⳤ⳪ⳒⲸⳠⳘⳁⳂ⳾ⳬⳤⳚ⳧ ⳀⲼⳲ⳩ⳀⲴ⳪⳪ⳖⳈⳖⳬⳠⳊⳢⳐⳖⳞⳃⲺⳖⳭⳜ</div>"},{"id":"marker130","name":"Rigurodula Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠧\udc30\ud802𐠴\udc2a\udc14 \udc15\udc2c𐠴\udc0d\ud802𐠞\udc34 \udc1f\ud802\ud802\ud802 𐠅\udc16\udc0b\ud802𐠫𐠅\ud802𐠖 𐠰𐠡𐠈\ud802\ud802  \ud802 \udc34\udc11\udc19\udc2f \udc29\udc0c𐠵 \udc2e𐠡𐠝\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠢\udc02\udc1f 𐠃\ud802\ud802\ud802\u