s migration","legend":"A huge group of ravens are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker161","name":"Hares migration","legend":"A huge group of hares are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker162","name":"Lions migration","legend":"A huge group of lions are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker163","name":"Castrum gathering","legend":"A gathering has been organised at Castrum as a chance to gather the suspected revolutionaries of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"id":"marker164","name":"Distant mirage","legend":"This distant mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker165","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker166","name":"Diaphanous mirage","legend":"This diaphanous mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker167","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker168","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker169","name":"Illusory mirage","legend":"This illusory mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker170","name":"Linnocobris Hole","legend":"The Linnocobris Hole. Locals claim that it is endlessly deep and unexplored."},{"id":"marker171","name":"Hoche Hole","legend":"The Hoche Hole. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"id":"marker172","name":"Aberf Pit","legend":"The Aberf Pit. Locals claim that it is endlessly deep and unexplored."},{"id":"marker173","name":"Draxningin Cemetery","legend":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are l